Package: ytdownloader
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3-pyqt6, yt-dlp, ffmpeg, ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: YouTube audio/video downloader with Qt GUI
 A Linux graphical tool for downloading YouTube files as audio or
 audio/video in the highest supported resolution, using yt-dlp.
 The interface accepts complete YouTube URLs or unique video IDs
 (the v= parameter). Features immediate validation, a download queue,
 progress bar with percent complete and ETA, auto-retry with
 exponential backoff (configurable), parallel downloads (configurable),
 and robust completion verification.
